The skin_microbiome example data are adapted from the count table and
metadata released with:
Potbhare R, RaviKumar A, Munukka E, Lahti L, Ashma R (2022).
Skin microbiota diversity among genetically unrelated individuals of
Indian origin. PeerJ 10:e13075. https://doi.org/10.7717/peerj.13075

These data retain their Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
The packaged data preserve the released counts and include simplified
metadata, taxonomy, and full-table library sizes. Preparation is documented
in inst/scripts/prepare_skin_microbiome.R and the skin_microbiome help page.
